<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of an English premier division soccer match on Sunday:</p>
